00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:19.280
And really the gold standard in terms of

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.039
metabolite transport is showing that in

00:20:21.039 --> 00:20:24.240
a liposome system. So a liposome is a

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.280
cell-free system. It&#x27;s a fake membrane,

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.039
circular membrane in which you put in

00:20:29.039 --> 00:20:30.960
your protein of interest. And so without

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.640
any other components, just your

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.640
