00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.960
fact what we do see with FOVC1. So

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:41.760
FOVCR1 alone can transport choline into

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.000
lipos.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.080
We also then did some work doing the

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.799
cryoM structure where we resolved a

00:20:48.799 --> 00:20:51.760
structure of Ethyl VCR1 bound to its

