of nailed down from a biochemical point

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:31.360
of view, this is the substrate of FVCR,

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:34.000
FLVR1, it&#x27;s choline.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.799
Um, okay. So this is all well and good.

00:21:36.799 --> 00:21:38.720
Like you found a transporter, it

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:41.120
transports something. Do cells even care

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:43.760
about having this? And surprisingly, not

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:46.799
really. So only when we really really

