00:22:44.640 --> 00:22:47.280
gene are no longer there and you can do

00:22:47.280 --> 00:22:48.880
these types of experiments and it&#x27;s the

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:51.840
power of unbiased genetic screens and

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:54.640
what we&#x27;re able to find is that I don&#x27;t

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:55.919
want to walk through the details very

00:22:55.919 --> 00:22:57.840
carefully but we were able to find that

00:22:57.840 --> 00:22:59.679
there were other ways that cells were

00:22:59.679 --> 00:23:01.600
able to compensate for not having

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:04.320
