00:23:15.919 --> 00:23:18.400
find out new biology in this respect and

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:20.640
also we were able to see that one of the

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:22.080
hits in our screen was this other

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:23.760
transporter which is a family member of

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:27.120
LDCR1 called FLDR2 and we were able to

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:29.679
show that that itself also can transport

00:23:29.679 --> 00:23:31.600
choline.

00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:33.919
Okay, again this is cool. This is in

00:23:33.919 --> 00:23:35.919
mice, but what happens or this is in

00:23:35.919 --> 00:23:37.760
cells, but what happens in an organismal

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:39.679
context? What happens if you don&#x27;t have

00:23:39.679 --> 00:23:42.400
apple one and no choline transport in

